{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02300",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.39,
      "end_seconds": 5.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Hello? Doctor? I was told to come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.93,
      "end_seconds": 9.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.27,
      "end_seconds": 18.5,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Well, I've been having breathlessness months after the infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.5,
      "end_seconds": 24.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Okay, can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.05,
      "end_seconds": 30.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "I've had it for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.22,
      "end_seconds": 43.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.47,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.6,
      "end_seconds": 61.17,
      "duration_seconds": 15.57,
      "text": "I'd say moderate. It's on and off. I told myself I'd wait and see, you know, and here I am. So, there's extreme tiredness as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 76.08,
      "end_seconds": 83.04,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain, coughing up blood or leg swelling?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.76,
      "end_seconds": 91.91,
      "duration_seconds": 7.15,
      "text": "So, I haven't had chest pain, coughing up blood or leg swelling, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.97,
      "end_seconds": 95.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Alright, have you had any fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.7,
      "end_seconds": 102.46,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, not at all, no fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.76,
      "end_seconds": 107.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Ah. On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.38,
      "end_seconds": 109.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "Nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.96,
      "end_seconds": 113.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.2,
      "end_seconds": 116.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.11,
      "end_seconds": 122.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.68,
      "end_seconds": 124.71,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "I have heart failure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.44,
      "end_seconds": 128.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.86,
      "end_seconds": 140.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.86,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. I hardly move around during the day. I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.99,
      "end_seconds": 143.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.22,
      "text": "Any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.41,
      "end_seconds": 146.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "No, not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.08,
      "end_seconds": 152.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.32,
      "end_seconds": 158.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.59,
      "end_seconds": 163.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.89,
      "end_seconds": 167.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.54,
      "end_seconds": 178.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.46,
      "end_seconds": 193.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.44,
      "end_seconds": 222.6,
      "duration_seconds": 9.16,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 15, temperature is 36.5 degrees, saturation 98 percent, pulse is 77 beats a minute, pressure 111 over 74."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.69,
      "end_seconds": 225.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 226.86,
      "end_seconds": 229.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Okay, I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.56,
      "end_seconds": 233.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.86,
      "end_seconds": 235.56,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.91,
      "end_seconds": 239.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.36,
      "end_seconds": 260.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Your oxygen is normal at rest and after walking and your chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.79,
      "end_seconds": 265.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "You can sit up now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.44,
      "end_seconds": 296.39,
      "duration_seconds": 20.95,
      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. This is probably post-viral symptoms after COVID. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. We shouldn't forget a thyroid problem. I'll request a chest X-ray, it'll help with persistent breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 298.31,
      "end_seconds": 300.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.64,
      "end_seconds": 306.17,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "I'm sending you for blood tests because of post-viral fatigue."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.04,
      "end_seconds": 311.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "That makes sense."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.35,
      "end_seconds": 338.45,
      "duration_seconds": 26.1,
      "text": "Pace your activity and increase it slowly each week. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. See me again in six weeks. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.29,
      "end_seconds": 344.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.08,
      "end_seconds": 346.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
}